# netsurf: a change while a <style>'s text update is pending is walked against the live cascade too (patch 458)
# Generated 2026-11-26
# Base: seleron/vitabrowser (patch stack through 457)
#
# 455 walked any change during a load against the live selection context
# but left out a sheet whose text update is pending (modified): "sheet
# change: a sheet is still loading or changing" stayed at 2.0 a load in
# the 457 census. The full reconvert neither processes that update nor
# refreshes the context while a sheet is unsettled -- and a modified sheet
# is (html_css_sheets_settled) -- so it cascades the live context as it
# is, which still holds the sheet's OLD version until
# html_css_process_modified_style swaps it out. The walk against the live
# context is that rebuild's result again; the new version marks its own
# batch when it is done. html_rl_sheet_modified goes.
#
